564- * userId with no session check, no ownership check and no rate limit, returning
565- * a raw boolean and spending a backup code — an unauthenticated 2FA
566- * brute-force oracle against any named account, reachable without logging in and
567- * bypassing login()'s throttle entirely. `safeNext` had to be moved out of
568- * lib/actions.ts for the same reason.
569- *
570- * Both were fixed by moving ONE function. Neither fix stopped it happening to
571- * the next function, because nothing checked. These tests check — across every
572- * "use server" module in lib/, on every export, every run.
573- * ================================================================== */
